    <string name="error_msg_reminder_not_found">Error: Reminder not found</string>
    <string name="error_msg_reminder_not_saved">Could not save the reminder. Nothing was changed.</string>
    <!-- The reminder was saved, but the alarm that makes it go off was not set. Not the
         same thing as not saving it: there is nothing to correct and nothing to send
         again, so the dialog closes and this says what the user cannot see. -->
    <string name="error_msg_reminder_saved_not_scheduled">Reminder saved, but it may not go off as set.</string>
    <!-- Mark done or delete: the store did change, and the list shows it, but the alarm
         or the notification that should have been cleared may still be there. It says
         nothing about what changed, because the same message answers for a reminder
         that was marked done and one that was deleted. -->
    <string name="error_msg_reminder_alarm_or_notification_not_cleared">The reminder\'s alarm or notification may still be there.</string>

