    <string name="dialog_reminders_unreadable_message">The saved reminders could not be read, so they were set aside and the app started with an empty list. Nothing has been deleted.\n\nYou can share the raw data to keep a copy or send it with a bug report, or discard it. This message comes back every time you open the app until you discard the data.</string>
